{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Observations.strangelet_crossing_energy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Observations.strangelet_crossing_energy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.Shared.ArchimedeanEval"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.strangelet_crossing_energy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.strangelet_crossing_energy","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L67-L95","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\n**Proposition.**\nLet $\\mathcal{S}_N$ be a composite of $N$ baryon-number units of\nstrange quark matter, each containing one up, one down, and one\nstrange quark in a Borromean triple\n$\\mathcal{B}_3(\\mathfrak{u}, \\mathfrak{d}, \\mathfrak{s})$ linked\nby the Hopf link $\\mathcal{L}_H$.  Then:\n\nThe Lean encoding below derives the equalities and inequalities from the hypothesis class. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:strangelet-crossing-energy","label":"prop:strangelet-crossing-energy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/strangelet-crossing-energy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.udd_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.udd_binding","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L65-L65","doc":"Formula for binding energy of udd. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.uds_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.uds_binding","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L63-L63","doc":"Formula for binding energy of uds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.claim_ii_purely_strong_crossing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.claim_ii_purely_strong_crossing","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (ii) — Purely strong crossing energy:\n`E_cross = N · ½(n₊ + n₋)·(q + q⁻¹)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.claim_i_electromagnetic_neutrality","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.claim_i_electromagnetic_neutrality","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (i) — Electromagnetic neutrality:\n`Q(𝓑₃(u, d, s)) = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/strangelet_crossing_energy.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.StrangeletCrossingEnergyConjecture","kind":"class","line":52,"sourceLink":"http